--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 PARITY — web source read end-to-end; every branch + t() reproduced
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Data sources (via P1/S8 state-holder seam, NO view HTTP):
    useVehicles + useVehicleState  -> RangeStateDTO (rated_range / ideal_range, SI METERS)
    useUnits                       -> RangeBarUnitPrefs (distance km|mi|ft + locale)
    useTranslation('dashboard')    -> RangeBarStrings (P1/S10 facade)

  Numeric pipeline ported VERBATIM (lib/unitConversion.ts + lib/numberFormat.ts):
    converted   = convertDistanceFromSI(meters, unit)  = meters / {1000 | 1609.344 | 0.3048}
    valueText   = fmtNumber(converted, 0)              (grouped, half-away-from-zero)
    maxRange    = max(rated, ideal, 1)                 (SI denominator)
    barFraction = min(value / maxRange, 1)             (== web value/maxConverted)
    EPA variance= ((ideal - rated) / rated) * 100, 1dp, '+' when ideal >= rated
                  (rendered only when rated > 0 && ideal > 0)
    hasData     = state != null && (rated > 0 || ideal > 0)  -> else EmptyState

  Layouts:
    compact (cols==1 && rows==1)  : rated value (cyan #22d3ee) over "{unit} rated"
    standard                       : rated bar (#22d3ee) + ideal bar (#a78bfa) + EPA variance row
    (registry min is 1×2 so a clamped instance never enters compact — matches the web grid)

  States (every one renders — no hidden surfaces):
    loading (skeleton bars) · empty (ContentUnavailableView "No range data") ·
    error (retry affordance) · content · stale (warning banner + auto-refresh) ·
    offline (muted banner, cached value retained)

  i18n keys from source (resolve through P1/S10 facade, no English literals in code):
    widget.rangeBar="Range" · widget.rated="rated" · widget.ratedRange="Rated Range" ·
    widget.idealRange="Ideal Range" · widget.epaComparison="EPA variance" ·
    widget.noRange="No range data"   (+ registry name/description + native chrome/a11y keys)

  Registry (canonical registry/battery.ts -> "range-bar"):
    id=range-bar · category=battery · default 2×2 · min 1×2 · max 4×40 · slug=RangeBarWidget
    P1/S11 diagnostics: view.opened emitted once with surface slug "RangeBarWidget".

